{"page":11,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:70","surah":2,"ayah":70,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ ٱدْعُ لَنَا رَبَّكَ يُبَيِّن لَّنَا مَا هِىَ إِنَّ ٱلْبَقَرَ تَشَـٰبَهَ عَلَيْنَا وَإِنَّآ إِن شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ لَمُهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They said, ‘Call on your Lord for us, to show us [exactly] what it is: all cows are more or less alike to us. With God’s will, we shall be guided.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱدْعُ","en_gloss":"Pray","transliteration":"ud'ʿu","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَنَا","en_gloss":"for us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"(to) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُبَيِّن","en_gloss":"to make clear","transliteration":"yubayyin","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّنَا","en_gloss":"to us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"it (is)","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْبَقَرَ","en_gloss":"[the] cows","transliteration":"l-baqara","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَشَـٰبَهَ","en_gloss":"look alike","transliteration":"tashābaha","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"to us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَإِنَّآ","en_gloss":"And indeed we","transliteration":"wa-innā","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":15,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"wills","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَمُهْتَدُونَ","en_gloss":"(will) surely be those who are guided","transliteration":"lamuh'tadūna","verse_key":"2:70"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٧٠","en_gloss":"(70)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:70"}]},{"verse_key":"2:71","surah":2,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ إِنَّهُۥ يَقُولُ إِنَّهَا بَقَرَةٌ لَّا ذَلُولٌ تُثِيرُ ٱلْأَرْضَ وَلَا تَسْقِى ٱلْحَرْثَ مُسَلَّمَةٌ لَّا شِيَةَ فِيهَا ۚ قَالُوا۟ ٱلْـَٔـٰنَ جِئْتَ بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ فَذَبَحُوهَا وَمَا كَادُوا۟ يَفْعَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He replied, ‘It is a perfect and unblemished cow, not trained to till the earth or water the fields.’ They said, ‘Now you have brought the truth,’ and so they slaughtered it, though they almost failed to do so.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَقُولُ","en_gloss":"says","transliteration":"yaqūlu","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّهَا","en_gloss":"[Indeed] it","transliteration":"innahā","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَقَرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a cow","transliteration":"baqaratun","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ذَلُولٌۭ","en_gloss":"trained","transliteration":"dhalūlun","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُثِيرُ","en_gloss":"to plough","transliteration":"tuthīru","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَسْقِى","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"tasqī","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَرْثَ","en_gloss":"the field","transliteration":"l-ḥartha","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مُسَلَّمَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"sound","transliteration":"musallamatun","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":15,"ar":"شِيَةَ","en_gloss":"blemish","transliteration":"shiyata","verse_key":"2:71"},{"pos":16,"ar":"