{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:72"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"2:72"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَكْتُمُونَ","en_gloss":"concealing","transliteration":"taktumūna","verse_key":"2:72"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٧٢","en_gloss":"(72)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:72"}]},{"verse_key":"2:73","surah":2,"ayah":73,"ar_uthmani":"فَقُلْنَا ٱضْرِبُوهُ بِبَعْضِهَا ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يُحْىِ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ وَيُرِيكُمْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We said, ‘Strike the [body] with a part of [the cow]’: thus God brings the dead to life and shows His signs so that you may understand.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَقُلْنَا","en_gloss":"So We said","transliteration":"faqul'nā","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱضْرِبُوهُ","en_gloss":"Strike him","transliteration":"iḍ'ribūhu","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِبَعْضِهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"with a part of it","transliteration":"bibaʿḍihā","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Like this","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُحْىِ","en_gloss":"revives","transliteration":"yuḥ'yī","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","en_gloss":"the dead","transliteration":"l-mawtā","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيُرِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"and shows you","transliteration":"wayurīkum","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His Signs","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"perhaps you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَعْقِلُونَ","en_gloss":"use your intellect","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","verse_key":"2:73"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٧٣","en_gloss":"(73)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:73"}]},{"verse_key":"2:74","surah":2,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ قَسَتْ قُلُوبُكُم مِّنۢ بَعْدِ ذَٰلِكَ فَهِىَ كَٱلْحِجَارَةِ أَوْ أَشَدُّ قَسْوَةً ۚ وَإِنَّ مِنَ ٱلْحِجَارَةِ لَمَا يَتَفَجَّرُ مِنْهُ ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۚ وَإِنَّ مِنْهَا لَمَا يَشَّقَّقُ فَيَخْرُجُ مِنْهُ ٱلْمَآءُ ۚ وَإِنَّ مِنْهَا لَمَا يَهْبِطُ مِنْ خَشْيَةِ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَمَا ٱللَّهُ بِغَـٰفِلٍ عَمَّا تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Even after that, your hearts became as hard as rocks, or even harder, for there are rocks from which streams spring out, and some from which water comes when they split open, and others which fall down in awe of God: He is not unaware of what you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَسَتْ","en_gloss":"hardened","transliteration":"qasat","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قُلُوبُكُم","en_gloss":"your hearts","transliteration":"qulūbukum","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَهِىَ","en_gloss":"so they","transliteration":"fahiya","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَٱلْحِجَارَةِ","en_gloss":"(became) like [the] stones","transliteration":"kal-ḥijārati","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَشَدُّ","en_gloss":"stronger","transliteration":"ashaddu","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَسْوَةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"(in) hardness","transliteration":"qaswatan","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْحِجَارَةِ","en_gloss":"the stones","transliteration":"l-ḥijārati","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَمَا","en_gloss":"certainly (there are some) which","transliteration":"lamā","verse_key":