","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"ʿammā","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":37,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"2:74"},{"pos":38,"ar":"٧٤","en_gloss":"(74)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:74"}]},{"verse_key":"2:75","surah":2,"ayah":75,"ar_uthmani":"۞ أَفَتَطْمَعُونَ أَن يُؤْمِنُوا۟ لَكُمْ وَقَدْ كَانَ فَرِيقٌ مِّنْهُمْ يَسْمَعُونَ كَلَـٰمَ ٱللَّهِ ثُمَّ يُحَرِّفُونَهُۥ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا عَقَلُوهُ وَهُمْ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So can you [believers] hope that such people will believe you, when some of them used to hear the words of God and then deliberately twist them, even when they understood them?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ أَفَتَطْمَعُونَ","en_gloss":"Do you hope","transliteration":"afataṭmaʿūna","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"they will believe","transliteration":"yu'minū","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"[for] you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَقَدْ","en_gloss":"while indeed","transliteration":"waqad","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"(there) has been","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَرِيقٌۭ","en_gloss":"a party","transliteration":"farīqun","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَسْمَعُونَ","en_gloss":"(who used to) hear","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَلَـٰمَ","en_gloss":"(the) words","transliteration":"kalāma","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يُحَرِّفُونَهُۥ","en_gloss":"they distort it","transliteration":"yuḥarrifūnahu","verse_key":"2:75"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss